  unitName: Redcap
  unitId: 10051
  unitNumber: 68
  description: While Goblins act in groups, there are always a few that stand out.
    These individuals are called Redcaps. They act as leaders, wear red hats, wield
    brutal weapons and command the other Goblins. One theory suggests they were initially
    infused with a higher amount of evil, but more research is needed to prove this.
  summonDesc: Dye it red, you say?<br>If it's bloodshed you want,<br>then you have
    my blade!
  fusionDesc: How do you like my power now!<br>Impressive, isn't it!!
  evoDesc: My hat is my pride!<br>Wearing it, I become stronger!
